<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="cities" data-stagger><a class="city rv" href="/hoosier-cities/indianapolis-insurance-appraisal/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/indianapolis-skyline.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/indianapolis-skyline-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/indianapolis-skyline.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 300px" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2>Indianapolis</h2><small>Marion County · Central Indiana</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/hoosier-cities/fort-wayne-insurance-appraisal/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fort-wayne.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fort-wayne-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fort-wayne.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 300px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2>Fort Wayne</h2><small>Allen County · Northeast Indiana</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/hoosier-cities/evansville-insurance-appraisal/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/evansville.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/evansville-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/evansville.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 300px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2>Evansville</h2><small>Vanderburgh County · Southwest Indiana</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/hoosier-cities/south-bend-insurance-appraisal/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/south-bend.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/south-bend-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/south-bend.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 300px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2>South Bend</h2><small>St. Joseph County · Northern Indiana</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/hoosier-cities/carmel-insurance-appraisal/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/carmel.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/carmel-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/carmel.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 300px" width="1024" height="681" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2>Carmel</h2><small>Hamilton County · Central Indiana</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/hoosier-cities/fishers-insurance-appraisal/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/suburban-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/suburban-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/suburban-home.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 300px" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2>Fishers</h2><small>Hamilton County · Central Indiana</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/hoosier-cities/bloomington-insurance-appraisal/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/bloomington.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/bloomington-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/bloomington.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 300px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2>Bloomington</h2><small>Monroe County · South Central Indiana</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/hoosier-cities/hammond-insurance-appraisal/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hammond.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hammond-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hammond.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 300px" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2>Hammond</h2><small>Lake County · Northwest Indiana</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/hoosier-cities/lafayette-insurance-appraisal/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/lafayette.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/lafayette-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/lafayette.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 300px" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2>Lafayette</h2><small>Tippecanoe County · West Central Indiana</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/hoosier-cities/kokomo-insurance-appraisal/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/kokomo.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/kokomo-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/kokomo.webp 1048w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 300px" width="1048" height="590" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2>Kokomo</h2><small>Howard County · North Central Indiana</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/hoosier-cities/terre-haute-insurance-appraisal/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/terre-haute.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/terre-haute-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/terre-haute.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 300px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2>Terre Haute</h2><small>Vigo County · Wabash Valley</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/hoosier-cities/jeffersonville-insurance-appraisal/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/jeffersonville.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/jeffersonville-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/jeffersonville.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 300px" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2>Jeffersonville</h2><small>Clark County · Southern Indiana</small></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head left rv"><p class="kicker">Claim zones</p><h2>How claims differ across Indiana</h2><p>The same policy language plays out very differently in a South Bend bungalow under three feet of snow, a Fishers two-story after hail and an Evansville Victorian after an ice storm.</p></div><div class="zone-cards"><div class="zone-card rv"><div class="zone-card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-roof.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="zone-card-b"><p class="kicker">Hammond · South Bend · LaPorte</p><h2>Lake Michigan snow belt</h2><p>Lake County, Porter, LaPorte, St. Joseph and Elkhart counties get Indiana’s heaviest snow. Low-slope additions, porch roofs and pole barns take the load, and ice dams send meltwater into ceilings every winter.</p><p class="zone-links"><a href="/hoosier-cities/hammond-insurance-appraisal/">Hammond</a>, <a href="/hoosier-cities/south-bend-insurance-appraisal/">South Bend</a></p></div></div><div class="zone-card rv"><div class="zone-card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hail-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hail-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hail-roof.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1024" height="663" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="zone-card-b"><p class="kicker">Indianapolis · Carmel · Fishers · Kokomo</p><h2>Central hail corridor</h2><p>Storms crossing from the west regularly drop hail on Marion and Hamilton counties. Fast-growing suburbs share discontinued shingle and siding lines, so matching disputes follow nearly every big storm.</p><p class="zone-links"><a href="/hoosier-cities/indianapolis-insurance-appraisal/">Indianapolis</a>, <a href="/hoosier-cities/carmel-insurance-appraisal/">Carmel</a>, <a href="/hoosier-cities/fishers-insurance-appraisal/">Fishers</a>, <a href="/hoosier-cities/kokomo-insurance-appraisal/">Kokomo</a></p></div></div><div class="zone-card rv"><div class="zone-card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/supercell.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/supercell-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/supercell.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="zone-card-b"><p class="kicker">Lafayette · Terre Haute · Fort Wayne</p><h2>Wabash Valley &amp; farm country</h2><p>Open farmland lets storms build fast. Pole barns, grain bins and farmhouses in Tippecanoe, Vigo, Allen and the counties between them see wind and hail losses that need structure-by-structure valuation.</p><p class="zone-links"><a href="/hoosier-cities/lafayette-insurance-appraisal/">Lafayette</a>, <a href="/hoosier-cities/terre-haute-insurance-appraisal/">Terre Haute</a>, <a href="/hoosier-cities/fort-wayne-insurance-appraisal/">Fort Wayne</a></p></div></div><div class="zone-card rv"><div class="zone-card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm-trees.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm-trees-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ice-storm-trees.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1024" height="627" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="zone-card-b"><p class="kicker">Evansville · Bloomington · Jeffersonville</p><h2>Southern hills &amp; Ohio River</h2><p>Wooded hills, limestone country and river towns. Ice storms bring limbs down on roofs, tornadoes like Henryville’s in 2012 cut long paths, and historic brick and stone homes need specialized pricing.</p><p class="zone-links"><a href="/hoosier-cities/evansville-insurance-appraisal/">Evansville</a>, <a href="/hoosier-cities/bloomington-insurance-appraisal/">Bloomington</a>, <a href="/hoosier-cities/jeffersonville-insurance-appraisal/">Jeffersonville</a></p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="checker thin" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wrap cta-in rv"><div><h2>Don’t see your city?</h2><p>We cover every Indiana county. Call and tell us where the property is.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line light" href="/contact-us/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
